ollowing connection between the area of $D$ and the area of the image $T(D)$ under the action of $T:$\n\n$$\n\\text{Area}(T(D))=|det(T)|\\cdot \\text{Area}(D).\n$$\n\nFrom the diagram, we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Area}(D)=1\\cdot 1=1.\n$$\n\nComputing the determinant of $T,$ we get \n\n$$\ndet(T)=(-4)\\cdot 3-2\\cdot 1=-12-2=-14.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Area}(T(D)) & =|det(T)|\\cdot \\text{Area}(D) \\\\  & =|\\,-14\\,|\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =14.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14062337/state.json" "file_sha256" "10db4be79b372551811e9c8057554c4c907ccad3de5d46d2c1ca5143b8686c90"} {"question" "q-316598" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14062337/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "69b0c4f1e8b87d115dd43be36f5eacfb20bc6694e6674c5d0161a16bf5892105"} {"question" "q-316598" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14062337/state.json" "file_sha256" "10db4be79b372551811e9c8057554c4c907ccad3de5d46d2c1ca5143b8686c90"} {"question" "q-316598" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "14"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14062337/state.json" "file_sha256" "10db4be79b372551811e9c8057554c4c907ccad3de5d46d2c1ca5143b8686c90"} {"question" "q-316606" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The triangle $D$ has vertices $(1,1),(5,1),(3,4).$ What is the area of the image of $D$ under the action of the linear transformation $T$ with the standard matrix $T,$ given below?\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{ali